00:29:12.975 --> 00:29:16.315
Train yourself to get stuck because you can't- the aha,

00:29:16.315 --> 00:29:20.890
feeling comes right after the schemas have collapsed and I've got no idea.

00:29:20.890 --> 00:29:23.260
